<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP QUARTER-FINAL, FIRST LEG RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP QUARTER-FINAL, FIRST LEG RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South American Libertadores Cup quarter-final, first leg matches on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In Oruro, Bolivia: Bolivar (Bolivia) 2 Sporting Cristal (Peru) 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bolivar - Eduardo Jiguchi (45, penalty), Sergio Joao, (76)</p>
<p>Sporting Cristal - Luis Bonnet (83)</p>
<p>In Montevideo: Penarol (Uruguay) 1 Racing Club (Argentina) 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Roberto Lima (24)</p>
<p>In Santiago: Universidad Catolica (Chile) 2 Colo Colo (Chile) 1 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Universidad Catolica - David Bisconti (13), Alberto Acosta (42)</p>
<p>Colo Colo - Ivo Basay (64, penalty)</p>
<p>Playing May 27: Cruzeiro (Brazil) v Gremio (Brazil)</p>
</text>
